  trap:"",
  summary:["Hypervolemia: CVP ↑ PCWP ↑ · hypovolemia: CVP ↓ PCWP ↓ (A15)","Hx hypervolemia: positive I/O, cardiac disease, renal failure (A15)","Rx hypervolemia: restrict fluid intake, diuretic, treat underlying causes (A15)","สูงอายุ/โรคหัวใจ → ให้สารน้ำน้อยไว้ก่อน ระวัง volume overload (B26)"],
