  trap:"Ileus = hypovolemia ในตารางไฟล์ B ส่วน bowel edema = hypervolemia",
  summary:["Hypovolemia: weight loss, dry mucosa, poor skin turgor, ileus, normal CXR, IVC collapse, CVP/PCWP ↓ (B4, A15)","Hypervolemia: weight gain, engorged neck vein, crepitations, S3/S4, peripheral edema, bowel edema (B4, A15)","CXR hypervolemia: cardiomegaly, cephalization, pulmonary edema · EKG: MI, arrhythmia (B4)","Rx: hypovolemia → volume replacement · hypervolemia → restrict fluid, diuretic, treat cause"],
  kimg:["l072b_p4", "l072_p15"], tags:["Fluid & electrolyte","Pre-op & post-op","Colorectal"],
